    "items": [
      "`EncElk` 023A91: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "`DA05EncWhiteStag` 104F46: no record outside the table keeps its own level. `DA05QuestingBeast` 090CE2 uses it as its template but not for `Stats`, so changing 104F46 leaves the quest stag at level 1.",
      "Every other elk record (the female elk `EncElkFemale`, `EncElkFemaleSprigganCompanion`, the ghost stag `DA05QuestingBeastGhost`, which follows 090CE2, and the `Lvl*Prey` / `LvlElk` wrappers) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list.",
      "`EncDeer`, `DLC1EncDeerGlowing`: no templated record keeps its own level.",
      "Three more deer have no template and set their own level 1: `TestEncReinDeer` 0D249A (\"Deer\", placed ×3 in the wild, under Placed only); `DLC1EncDeerGlowingDEAD` 00F797:Dawnguard.esm (a Vale Deer placed dead ×3 in the Forgotten Vale and Darkfall Passage) and `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_DeerSpring` 000909:cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm, both on no census page.",
      "Every other deer record (`dunCGEncDeer`, `EncDeerSprigganCompanion`, the `LvlDeer` and `Lvl*Prey` wrappers) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list.",
      "`EncCow` 023A90: no templated record keeps its own level.",
      "Three more cows have no template and set their own level 3: `CWMission08EncCowPainted` 06681E (Civil War painted cow) and `EncCowNoRespawn` 00F9A9:Dawnguard.esm, both under Placed only; `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_AutumnCow` 0008F1:cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm (not placed), on no census page.",
      "Every other cow record (`EncCowPainted`, `RoriksteadCow`, the Soul Cairn `DLC01SoulCairnSoulCow`) carries `Stats` and follows 023A90.",
      "`EncChicken` 0A91A0: no templated record keeps its own level.",
      "`DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_AutumnChicken` 0008F0:cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm is a chicken with no template and level 1 (placed ×8 in the puzzle dungeon's autumn cell); it is on no census page.",
      "Every other chicken record (`SnowShodFarmChicken`, `dunTransmogrifyChicken`) carries `Stats` and follows 0A91A0."
    ]
  },
